# Carve to control speed on the 10% section: full-lean S-turns at 14 m/s ask a little more than the
# grip, so the board drifts and scrubs about as much as the slope gives: +0.4 m/s in 3.3 s, where
# riding straight gains more and the wobble throws you off (lab-hill-wobble). Carving damps the wobble.
park lab
spawn lab_hill_ten
cmd 6 speed 14
hold left 10..70
hold right 70..150
hold left 150..230
hold right 230..310
hold left 310..390
run 400
expect max skater.speed < 14.6 over 10..400
expect skater.speed > 13.8 at 400
expect max skater.wobble < 0.2
expect min skater.slip < -0.3
expect no event bail
